Package: NAFOSDM
Title: NAFO Regulatory Area Species Distribution Models under Climate Change Projections
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Neo", "Paulin", , "Neo.Paulin@dfo-mpo.gc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = "Fisheries and Oceans Canada (DFO/MPO)"),
    person("inSileco", role = "rev", email = "info@insileco.io")
  )
Description: Analysis project (not an installable package). This file lists
    the R packages needed to run the scripts in R/analysis/ and
    R/data-raw/, so they can be installed without renv, e.g. with
    pak::local_install_deps() or remotes::install_deps(dependencies = TRUE).
    Imports are needed by the core workflow (R/analysis/00_CodeCaller.R and
    the scripts it sources); Suggests are needed only by R/data-raw/ (gsw,
    ncdf4, R.utils) and R/archive/exploratory/.
